In my haste to respond to question posed on the announcement of a new
development site, I failed to include the postings to the list.

I would like to forward these responses for your review, so that everyone
will have a clear (or at least "better") view of what the site is all about.

I hope this will clarify the questions, and promote some more dialog.

I would also like to make it clear that I have been in touch with NAI
regarding this issue, and it is clear from that contact, they have no
objections, but rather positive input.. Mark Westerman also talked with an
official at the NSA, and has given them admin capabilities on the S/F site.
This would indicate (only by assumption), they too, are concerned with the
content and functionality of the site.

